 "id": 1896518,
 "titulo": "9/21 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1789974054245,
 "modificada": 1790046060843,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1896518",
 "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1789959572817\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/4db5b2cca5ee4f13ab3580540ee002f3_1789959572817_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">In this patch, you will encounter the visage of a terrifying skull&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">and a wizard who wields blood magic.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#9900ff;\">Tier-4</span> and New Uniforms have been added for<span style=\"color:#9900ff;\"> Sister Grimm</span>,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">who casts powerful magic through the 'Staff of One' summoned using blood as a medium,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">and <span style=\"color:#9900ff;\">Red Skull</span>, the ruthless strategist and head of the criminal organization Hydra,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">who aims for world domination.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Agents, please download the 9/21 (Mon) patch&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">to check out their new skills and enhanced power!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#740060;\">■ 9/21 Patch Details</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Patch Schedule: 9/22 (Tue) 3:00 (UTC+0), 9/21 (Mon) 20:00 (PDT)</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">[9/22 (Tue) 3:00&nbsp;(UTC+0), 9/21 (Mon) 20:00&nbsp;(PDT) added]</span><br>\nThe patch has been completed as of 9/22&nbsp;(Tue) 2:57&nbsp;(UTC+0), 9/21 (Mon) 19:57&nbsp;(PDT).<br>\nPlease reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#9900ff;\">Completion time will be announced once the patch has been completed.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* The patch will be applied in waves, and the application time may vary by Agent.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* The game can still be accessed during the patch.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">When the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff9300;\"><strong>▣ Two New Uniforms</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Two new Uniforms, Sister Grimm &lt;Princess Tsukimi&gt;,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">and Red Skull &lt;The Crimson Fall&gt; have been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff00ff;\">* The two new Uniforms can be purchased after the 9/21 Patch data has been applied.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff00ff;\">* New Uniforms are available for purchase during the Event period.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff00ff;\">* Seasonal Uniforms may be available for purchase again&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff00ff;\">after the event has been over through similar events or packages.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff00ff;\"><strong>* A 10% Agent Supplies discount coupon will be distributed in celebration of 2026 Autumn Token Shop.</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">- Coupon acquisition and available period:&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">9/21 (Mon) 15:00 – 10/6 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0),</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#4a86e8;\">9/21 (Mon) 8:00 – 10/6 (Tue) 7:59 (PDT)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">▶ Sister Grimm &lt;Princess Tsukimi&gt;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">After the 9/22 Patch - 10/9 (Fri) 14:59 (UTC+0),</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">After the 9/21 Patch - 10/9 (Fri) 7:59 (PDT)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- How to Purchase: Exchange for 2026 Autumn Token Shop Tokens in the Event Token Shop</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- 2026 Autumn Token Shop Tokens can be acquired until 10/6 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0) / 7:59 (PDT) through purchasing Event Products sold in-game and at the Agent Supplies and through other methods.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#27ae60;\"><strong>* Please check if the token is included before purchasing any product.</strong></span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ You can also obtain 2026 Autumn Token Shop Tokens from the Agent Supplies products,</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">and products that can grant these tokens are marked in the upper-right corner.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1789959763755\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/aacfe128c60d48c69c207116d4e1fd52_1789959763755_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Sale Period:</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">9/21 (Mon) 15:00 - 10/6 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">9/21 (Mon) 8:00 - 10/6 (Tue) 7:59 (PDT)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Please visit the Agent Supplies during this period to check them out.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://mffshop.netmarble.com/en\"><span style=\"color:null;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[Go to Agent Supplies]</span></span></span></a></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">▶ Red Skull &lt;The Crimson Fall&gt;</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">After the 9/22 Patch - 10/6 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0),</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">After the 9/21 Patch - 10/6 (Tue) 7:59 (PDT)</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- How to Purchase: Crystal purchase (Discount event will not be applied.)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects of the new Uniforms are based on the maximum skill level stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1680\" id=\"1789959815068\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/cf77020896b34cffa10724b06584e842_1789959815068_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1480\" id=\"1789959820149\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/87ad74e3deef465eb1eff77f2595cd91_1789959820149_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff9900;\"><strong>▣ Sister Grimm &amp; Red Skull Tier-4</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Tier-4 Advancements have been added for Sister Grimm,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">who is carving out her own life after escaping her dark mage parents,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">and Red Skull, who seeks to prove his absolute superiority and force the whole world into submission.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">* The Tier-4 Striker Skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"295\" id=\"1789959838342\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/05d739fdbf5a46ed9b35758135c5e378_1789959838342_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"345\" id=\"1789959845146\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fa20c50cbd9d4498bf5f64779c47d155_1789959845146_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff9300;\"><strong>▣ </strong></span><span style=\"color:#ff9900;\"><strong>New Artifact</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">After the September patch, an Exclusive Passive Skill Artifact for Red Skull will be added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c;\">﻿* The skill effects are based on Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"329\" id=\"1789959865043\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a77937b2d8294f3b981beab95cbd9674_1789959865043_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff9300;\"><strong>▣ </strong></span><span style=\"color:#ff9900;\"><strong>Game Error Fixes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. Fixed a typo that was incorrectly displayed in Galactus's info in certain languages.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. Updated the guidance text regarding 1st Potential Realization requirements in the Hero Info.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We look forward to your active participation in the events&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">that will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1789959568848\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/7f28544264e7421baba4cb183376df5a_1789959568848_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n"
}